<title>USA: CCC buys 2,170 T US HRW wheat for export to Uganda.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 2,170 T US HRW wheat for export to Uganda.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said Thursday it had bought 2,170 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat from ADM Co for export to Uganda, March 1-25 shipment.</p>
<p>The wheat was priced at $178.87 a tonne, FOB Ama.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
